   "reviewed": {
    "by": "claude",
    "date": "2026-11-05",
    "note": "The bundled PostgreSQL client libraries: libpq, libkrb5, libldap and libcrypto import the network calls a database client needs (TLS, Kerberos, LDAP lookup of the service); libpq's popen is linked, never named in a URL or address; prctl names threads. No URLs or addresses. Content review only."
   },
